OL,3,GNEWSACyclist dies after crash with
OL,4,Alorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cyclist has died after being involved
OL,7,Fin a crash with a blue lorry.
OL,9,FAvon and Somerset Police said officers
OL,10,Fwere called to reports of the crash on
OL,11,Fthe A4320 St Philips Causeway in
OL,12,FBristol at 09:00 GMT on Monday and then
OL,13,Fclosed the dual carriageway in both
OL,14,Fdirections.
OL,16,FEmergency services attended but the
OL,17,Fcyclist, a man in his 50s, died at the
OL,18,Fscene, said a police spokesperson.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
